<title>USA: PHLX to trade Premier Laser options.</title>
<headline>PHLX to trade Premier Laser options.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philadelphia Stock Exchange (PHLX) said Wednesday it will begin trading options on shares of Premier Laser Systems Inc on July 9.</p>
<p>The exchange said the options will open with strike prices of 10, 12-1/2 and 15, with position limits of 10,500 contracts. Initial expirations will be in August, September, November and February.</p>
<p>Group One Ltd has been named the specialist for the options.</p>
<p>((--Chicago derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
